{"story":{"id":"site-it-was-aliens-site","title":{"zh":"废墟","en":"Ruins"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/4ce8285eb4917aef3742.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:it_was_aliens_site","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"废墟遍布[From.Planet.GetName]，但奇怪的是，从它们的爆炸模式来看，似乎是大量的地下核爆引发了这一切，而不是正常的大气层核爆或是轨道轰炸。这需要进一步调查，或许需要一次考古挖掘来揭露这里到底发生了什么。","en":"Ruins cover [From.Planet.GetName], but oddly the blast patterns seem to indicate that vast nuclear explosions occurred underneath the surface rather than from atmospheric or orbital bombardment. This warrants further investigation, but it will require an archa"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:it_was_aliens_site","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.104","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1646"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.105","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.106","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:it_was_aliens_site","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"废墟","en":"Ruins"},"texts":[{"zh":"废墟遍布[From.Planet.GetName]，但奇怪的是，从它们的爆炸模式来看，似乎是大量的地下核爆引发了这一切，而不是正常的大气层核爆或是轨道轰炸。这需要进一步调查，或许需要一次考古挖掘来揭露这里到底发生了什么。","en":"Ruins cover [From.Planet.GetName], but oddly the blast patterns seem to indicate that vast nuclear explosions occurred underneath the surface rather than from atmospheric or orbital bombardment. This warrants further investigation, but it will require an archaeological dig to reveal what happened here."}],"sections":[{"zh":"废墟遍布[From.Planet.GetName]，但奇怪的是，从它们的爆炸模式来看，似乎是大量的地下核爆引发了这一切，而不是正常的大气层核爆或是轨道轰炸。这需要进一步调查，或许需要一次考古挖掘来揭露这里到底发生了什么。","en":"Ruins cover [From.Planet.GetName], but oddly the blast patterns seem to indicate that vast nuclear explosions occurred underneath the surface rather than from atmospheric or orbital bombardment. This warrants further investigation, but it will require an archaeological dig to reveal what happened here."}],"image":"art/4ce8285eb4917aef3742.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.104","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1646","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-it-was-aliens-site"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29651","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8000"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29651","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8001"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29651","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8002"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29651","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:5","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8003"},{"target":"ancrel.8010","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29651","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],